    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8984d00d4e3b8a8dc3175a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛在千钧一发之际冲过了吊桥。\n她也拜此所赐而培养出了胆量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5fba1a1f6ec06c739d124b10f518d74d170c59d2788dc35f4ed2b5b5638f02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430817f77827736066b84a71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，就让她在今年的春天\n像这样一点一滴地成长，\n然后稳健踏实地向上爬吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a937503b3f1e8176f0b50e4a2208f7254dede6256e2bdcffa16024de09172b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
