      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（看她一脸认真，不知道在许什么愿呢？\n而且……总觉得她看起来好寂寞……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "389828d1e29250fa75b4d1028f0fb441d451f6b4e14926a18ce356ed3081bdc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
