    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59def27203e535481d408c71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呀啊啊啊啊啊，训练员────\n风筝……风筝撞到地上，\n摔得四分五裂了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e7621ec577d818bbcb7c3b0c1886f2e06df0079b492a955481e43634fdd64c",
