      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呀啊啊啊，陀螺……陀螺“咻！”一声\n从绳子上飞出去──哇哇哇哇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "587760ce6e9adb3984522bc4f1fd058d124a136426270f55ac09e0e1e2c416e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
