      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛不管玩什么游戏都手忙脚乱的。\n不过她似乎在游戏之中，\n学到了各式各样的技巧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bce1939ec8fed4fde7fa77f363d22ff9d28e620a3019aa1f6882d1030ae86c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
